  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA-only models (config_005) achieve high accuracy (0.6501) with scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation. This experiment tests a multimodal extension of this baseline by adding resnet50 image encoder, isolating the impact of image data integration. It directly addresses whether combining RNA and image modalities improves performance, building on the established effectiveness of multiprofile and scvi_n200, while keeping aggregation method consistent to isolate fusion effects."
}

